ly on change. | `ansible-playbook playbooks/issue-deploy-certs.yml -e \"certs_filter=domain.com\"` |\n| [**`kdbx-pool.yml`**](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/kdbx-pool.yml) *(symlink: [`search-servers.yml`](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/search-servers.yml))* | `localhost` | Synchronizes server entries and credentials from KeePass (`.kdbx`) into Ansible inventory caches and CLI search indexes. | `ansible-playbook playbooks/kdbx-pool.yml -e 'action=sync'` |\n\n---\n\n### Supporting Files & Subdirectories\n\n* [**`tasks/`**](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/tasks): Modular task lists for certificate handling:\n  * [`deploy_and_reload_cert.yml`](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/tasks/deploy_and_reload_cert.yml)\n  * [`issue_and_queue_cert.yml`](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/tasks/issue_and_queue_cert.yml)\n* [**`group_vars/all/`**](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/group_vars/all): Configuration and vault secrets:\n  * [`certificates.yml`](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/group_vars/all/certificates.yml)\n  * [`vault.yml`](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/group_vars/all/vault.yml) *(Ansible-Vault encrypted)*\n  * [`vault.yml.example`](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/group_vars/all/vault.yml.example)\n* [**`files/`**](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/files): DNS-01 authentication & cleanup hooks for Certbot (PowerDNS, NS1).\n* [**`templates/`**](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/templates): Jinja2 templates (e.g. [`rfc2136-credentials.ini.j2`](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/templates/rfc2136-credentials.ini.j2))."}
